1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:08,000
sent 2.0s: Tex Lexington canters down the main street of the Mars frontier town; settlers in white cotton look up; a donkey carrying yellow jerrycans crosses in front of him.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
sent 8.0s: The towering Martian dust storm rolls into town, swallowing the mesas, the saloons and the stelae; red dust swirls around Tex and his horse.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
sent 13.0s: Red dust fills the entire frame; only Tex's white shamma cloak and his hat show through the storm.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
sent 18.0s: The storm blows past behind him and the dust clears: the frontier town has become a gleaming future city of Ethiopia on Mars, with copper towers carved like rock-hewn churches, green fields under glass domes, water channels and a train on tall pylons.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:31,000
sent 24.0s: Tex rides on through a wide plaza of the future city; Black Ethiopian settlers in white cotton and silver suits wave to him; drones carry water overhead.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,458
sent 31.0s: Under the two moons Tex slows his horse in front of a church carved into the red rock in the shape of a cross, glowing at dusk, the camera locked behind him.
